  "name": "League Champions & Rift Quality Pack / \u82f1\u96c4\u4e0e\u5ce1\u8c37\u54c1\u8d28\u5347\u7ea7",
  "author": "BoDUD",
  "version": "0.10.15",
  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.15 targets Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.1 and uses the matching official 0.5.1 SDK. Versions 0.10.11 through 0.10.14 are retained as failed portrait-route records: 0.10.11 assumed dynamic card roots were named by champion id, 0.10.12 required an unreachable ChampionInfoUIRunner, 0.10.13 mistook the post-SetImageScale screenshot size for RenderCommand geometry, and 0.10.14 fixed only the 85x93 management-card route while the reported screen was the 90x122 BP champion grid. The default 0.10.15 Yone-only extension keeps the 85x93 management-card replacement and now also executes the existing independent Yone portrait rewrite, routing only Yone actor NinePatch commands at the BP-grid geometry to the source-direct ui/champion_portrait/dual_blader_grid texture while preserving x/y/w/h, clearing the texture rectangle and borders, and enabling nearest sampling. It also retains the Yone-only compact and scoreboard portrait routes. RenderCommand::Sprite battle actors and other champions cannot match. The broader legacy MatchUIRunner, ClientDatabase, picked-side splash, dragon, server and other-champion rewrites remain explicitly opt-in. Bounded telemetry records the actual Yone command variant, pass, texture, geometry and a dedicated yone_bp_grid_replace event. V6 keeps the official 3502x88 battle canvas, 13 animation tags, rectangles, labels and timings; Q/W/R gameplay, effects, icons and audio remain unchanged, as does the saved-season floor introduced in 0.10.5. A save first created on 0.10.5 or later remains valid. Spirit Cleave still performs one stateless 80-degree, 42000-range GameCtx cone scan with no process-global ledger, deals 35 + 45% Attack + 6% target maximum-health physical damage, and settles one shield tier for zero through five champions hit; Mod API 0.8 still requires fixed 0.5-second cast and 8-second cooldown. Retired E and 0.10.4 rectangular-W native names remain no-op saved-data compatibility only so old embedded trees do not crash after BP. Automated source and build checks do not constitute live visual acceptance; the 0.10.15 BP-grid route remains pending in-game user verification.",
  "last_updated": "2026-07-21",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.5.1"
    }
  ]
}
